OL,3,GNEWSAManx national treasures celebrated
OL,4,Awith stamp set
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of the Isle of Man's most
OL,7,Fremarkable archaeological discoveries
OL,8,Fhave been celebrated in a new set of
OL,9,Fstamps.
OL,11,FThe six-piece Manx National Treasures
OL,12,Fcollection features items spanning more
OL,13,Fthan 3,500 years of the island's
OL,14,Fhistory.
OL,16,FA collaboration between the Isle of Man
OL,17,FPost Office and Manx National Heritage
OL,18,F(MNH), the collection is said to offer
OL,19,Fan "insight into the people, traditions
OL,20,Fand stories that have shaped the
OL,21,Fisland's history".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
